DESCRIPTION:Ever wonder where to look up government salaries\, court recor
 ds\, or \ncampaign donations in Utah? Join a free virtual training led by
  Eric \nPeterson of the Utah Investigative Journalism Project. He'll walk
  \nthrough Transparent Utah\, the state courts portal\, campaign finance 
 \nrecords\, and other public databases you can search from home. \nPresen
 ted as part of the Moab Sun News Sun Civics training series\, \nco-hosted
  by the Grand County Public Library. Free and open to all — \nno experien
 ce needed. https://grandcountyutah.net/calendar.aspx?EID=16635
